Data
----
spec/data/solar-terms.v1.json contains solar-term timestamps for 1899–2101.
They were computed offline with sxtwl 2.0.7 and cross-checked against
lunar_python 1.4.8 (tools/gen_solar_terms.py). Neither library is bundled
or required at runtime; they are only used by the scripts in tools/.

packages/core/test/fixtures/oracle-pillars.json contains reference Four
Pillars computed with lunar_python 1.4.8 (tools/gen_oracle_pillars.py),
used only by tests.
